    "summary_ko": "Azure·Copilot 운영사(워싱턴주 레드먼드). AI 전용 자체 캠퍼스로 위스콘신 Mount Pleasant 의 \"Fairwater\"(1단계 2026-06 완전 가동, 2단계 2028 완공 목표, 북쪽 15개 동 추가 승인)를 짓고 있으며, Fairwater Atlanta(QTS 소유 건물 임차)와 Nebius·IREN·Nscale·Lambda·CoreWeave·Crusoe 등 외부 용량을 함께 확보한다. FY2026 설비투자(현금) $115.9bn, 아직 개시 전인 데이터센터 위주 임대 약정 $329.1bn.",
    "summary_en": "Redmond-based operator of Azure and Copilot. Its own AI-dedicated campus is \"Fairwater\" in Mount Pleasant, Wisconsin (phase 1 fully operational June 2026, phase 2 due 2028, 15 more buildings approved to the north); it also uses Fairwater Atlanta (QTS-owned buildings, leased) and third-party capacity from Nebius, IREN, Nscale, Lambda, CoreWeave and Crusoe. FY2026 cash capex was $115.9bn, with $329.1bn of mostly datacenter leases not yet commenced.",
