        "summary_ko": "Microsoft 가 직접 짓고 소유·운영하는 첫 Fairwater AI 데이터센터(옛 Foxconn 부지). 1단계(315에이커, 3개 동 120만 ft², GB200 NVL72 수십만 개)는 2026-04 장비 가동·시운전, 2026-06-23 완전 가동. 바로 옆 2단계($4bn, \"비슷한 규모\")는 기초·철골 공사 중으로 2028 완공 목표. 2026-01 북쪽에 15개 동(약 900만 ft²·변전소 3곳) 추가 승인. 전력은 We Energies(VLC 요금제 2026-04 승인) — Microsoft 는 1단계 최대 400MW, 몇 년 내 900MW 를 언급했고 WEC 는 2030년까지 2.6GW 수요를 전망.",
        "summary_en": "Microsoft's first self-built, owned and operated Fairwater AI datacenter on former Foxconn land. Phase 1 (315 acres, three buildings, 1.2M sq ft, hundreds of thousands of GB200 GPUs) brought equipment online in April 2026 and was fully operational on June 23, 2026. Adjacent phase 2 ($4bn, 'similar size and scale') is in foundation/steel work, due 2028. Fifteen more buildings (~9M sq ft, three substations) to the north were approved in Jan 2026. Power from We Energies (VLC tariff approved Apr 2026): Microsoft cited 400MW max for phase 1 and up to 900MW in a few years; WEC forecasts 2.6GW of Microsoft demand by 2030.",
