            "note_en": "Secured 400MW from May 2024: no disclosed interconnection figure. Uses the \"400MW maximum for phase 1\" Microsoft cited in Sep 2025 (Fox6; Data Center Frontier citing state filings). A 2024 DNR filing sized the new substation at 752MW+ (WPR, Tier 2).",
            "source": "https://www.fox6now.com/news/microsoft-wisconsin-next-infrastructure-investment-announced"
          },
          {
            "note": "확보 전력 900MW(2025-09~): Microsoft \"몇 년 내 900MW 필요할 수 있음\"(Fox6), DCF \"전체(1·2단계) 약 900MW 접근\"(주 인허가 자료). We Energies VLC 요금제 승인(2026-04)·WEC 2.6GW 수요 전망으로 공급 의지는 확인되나 계통 연결 계약 MW 는 미공개 → 추정.",
            "note_en": "Secured 900MW from Sep 2025: Microsoft said needs \"might be 900MW\" in a few years (Fox6); DCF cites state filings at ~900MW full build-out. Utility commitment is evident (VLC tariff Apr 2026; WEC 2.6GW forecast) but the contracted interconnection MW is not public → estimate.",
            "source": "https://www.datacenterfrontier.com/hyperscale/article/55317925/inside-microsofts-global-ai-infrastructure-the-fairwater-blueprint-for-distributed-supercomputing"
          },
          {
            "note": "통전 400MW(2026-04~): WEC 는 1단계 운영 개시(2026-04)만 공시. 실제 통전 MW 미공개 → 1단계 최대 400MW 로 가정.",
            "note_en": "Energized 400MW from Apr 2026: WEC discloses only that phase 1 operations began in April 2026; energized MW undisclosed → assumes the 400MW phase-1 maximum.",
            "source": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/783325/000078332526000099/a092026septemberfinal002.htm"
          },
          {
            "note": "2단계 500MW(grid) = 900MW(몇 년 내 총수요) − 400MW(1단계). Microsoft 는 \"비슷한 규모\"라고만 밝힘. 착공 2025-Q4 와 진행률 0.3 은 2026-06 \"기초·철골·지하설비 공사 중\", 2028 완공 일정에서 선형 근사.",
            "note_en": "Phase 2 500MW (grid) = 900MW near-term total − 400MW phase 1; Microsoft only says \"similar size and scale\". Start 2025-Q4 and progress 0.3 are linear approximations from the June 2026 \"foundation, steel erection, underground utilities\" status and 2028 completion.",
