            "note_en": "Coordinates: centroid of the phase-1 parcel bounds (south of Braun Rd, north of County Hwy KR, east of CP rail, west of 90th St, per WISN citing village TID 5 documents) fitted to OpenStreetMap roads. The 15-building north expansion lies ~3–4km north (Durand Ave / International Dr) and is grouped in this site.",
